            "Allende has been called “the Rosetta Stone of the solar system”, because its inclusions let us read the chronology of the very first moments of our planetary system. It is said to help with new beginnings, connect with the origins and stimulate understanding. It is associated with the crown and root chakras and the sign of Aquarius. Avoid water and humidity; dust with a brush; keep dry with desiccant; cleanse by smudging."
